WEBVTT

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:18.926
[angry roar]

00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:21.364
[panting heavily]

00:00:31.286 --> 00:00:34.289
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.

00:00:34.464 --> 00:00:37.423
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?

00:00:37.597 --> 00:00:39.947
[Gerald] Infusing the core...

00:00:40.121 --> 00:00:41.601
with chaos energy.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.387
That's my little secret.

00:00:44.561 --> 00:00:47.172
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:50.131
into a flaming pile
of rubble,

00:00:50.305 --> 00:00:55.136
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.

00:00:58.313 --> 00:01:00.490
Including us.

00:01:04.407 --> 00:01:05.669
What?

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:09.673
We can't annihilate
the Earth!

00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:14.286
- Hmm?
- By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.374
Together!

00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:18.638
Humanity is a failed experiment.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:21.032
If anyone should know that,
it's you.

00:01:22.773 --> 00:01:25.689
All your life, you've been
rejected by this world.

00:01:26.559 --> 00:01:28.213
You have nothing down there.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.869
No one who cares about you.

00:01:33.653 --> 00:01:35.220
But I have you now.

00:01:37.918 --> 00:01:39.311
We're family.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.835
We have each other.

00:01:43.315 --> 00:01:44.577
Oh, Ivo...

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.102
you're no Maria.

00:01:51.454 --> 00:01:55.414
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!

00:01:57.068 --> 00:01:58.809
The only way
to give Maria's life
meaning

00:01:58.983 --> 00:02:01.246
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.

00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:04.249
So I'm burning it all down!

00:02:06.947 --> 00:02:08.122
It's done.

00:02:08.296 --> 00:02:10.603
Good work, Shadow.

00:02:10.777 --> 00:02:12.649
I'm prepping
the firing sequence.

00:02:12.823 --> 00:02:16.696
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.

00:02:20.657 --> 00:02:22.746
It's almost finished, Maria.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.010
You will have justice.

00:02:26.184 --> 00:02:27.794
[muffled, distant boom]

00:02:30.405 --> 00:02:31.711
What is that?

00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:35.585
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?

00:02:35.759 --> 00:02:38.805
Impossible.
It's moving too fast.

00:02:42.026 --> 00:02:43.549
It's him.

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:49.207
[wind whistling]

00:02:49.381 --> 00:02:50.861
[both grunting]

00:02:52.036 --> 00:02:56.344
You hurt my family.
This ends now!

00:02:56.519 --> 00:02:58.216
Now you know my anger.

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:01.262
The pain I've felt
for 50 years.

00:03:01.436 --> 00:03:04.701
And you've made
the same choice I did.

00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:06.441
I'm nothing like you!

00:03:06.616 --> 00:03:07.704
We'll see.

00:03:07.878 --> 00:03:10.315
[both yelling]

00:03:15.538 --> 00:03:17.148
Show yourself, coward!

00:03:18.366 --> 00:03:19.542
[grunts]

00:03:21.282 --> 00:03:22.370
[grunts]

00:03:23.197 --> 00:03:24.155
[gasps]

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.340
[screams]

00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:47.395
[shouts]

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:48.788
[thunder reverberating]

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.616
You were right about one thing.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.835
[straining]

00:03:52.487 --> 00:03:54.838
This ends now.

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:58.058
[both grunting]

00:04:21.429 --> 00:04:22.474
What's happening?

00:04:22.648 --> 00:04:23.780
Where are they?

00:04:24.824 --> 00:04:26.086
- Up there.
- Where?

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.174
- Higher.
- Hmm?

00:04:27.348 --> 00:04:28.741
[shocked gagging]

00:04:28.915 --> 00:04:30.177
Left yourself open.

00:04:30.351 --> 00:04:32.136
Ivo! What are you doing?

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.703
Thwarting your evil plan!

00:04:40.274 --> 00:04:42.189
[both howling in pain]

00:04:44.627 --> 00:04:46.585
- Not the mustache!
- Agreed.

00:04:46.759 --> 00:04:49.457
Let go on three.
One, two, three!

00:04:50.241 --> 00:04:51.721
[whiskers flapping]

00:04:51.895 --> 00:04:53.070
[beeps]

00:04:54.637 --> 00:04:57.901
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.

00:04:58.075 --> 00:05:01.774
I haven't seen that
since I hate-watched
<i>Green Lantern</i> in 2011.

00:05:01.948 --> 00:05:03.907
I was saving it for Comic-Con.

00:05:04.081 --> 00:05:06.126
But now there won't
be a Comic-Con!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.345
[yells]

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.654
[both grunting]

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:22.012
[dust settling]

00:05:28.758 --> 00:05:31.804
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?

00:05:31.978 --> 00:05:33.501
[straining]

00:05:33.676 --> 00:05:36.069
They tried to stop you,
didn't they?

00:05:36.243 --> 00:05:37.723
But you came anyway.

00:05:37.897 --> 00:05:40.334
Your anger was too much.

00:05:40.508 --> 00:05:43.250
What kind of hero
abandons his friends

00:05:43.424 --> 00:05:45.470
to pursue revenge?

00:05:45.644 --> 00:05:47.951
Abandons his family!

00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:50.736
Don't you dare talk
about my family.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.652
And here I thought
you cared for them.

00:05:53.826 --> 00:05:56.960
Especially the one...
What's his name?

00:05:57.134 --> 00:05:58.352
Tom?

00:05:58.526 --> 00:06:00.528
[angry howl]

